    <string name="voice_builtin_title">Built-in Arabic engine</string>
    <string name="voice_builtin_hint">Works without Google speech services and without internet, on any device. Downloads an open-source model (Vosk, Apache 2.0, about 320 MB) from alphacephei.com once. Standard Arabic is recognized best, dialects less accurately. Wi-Fi recommended.\n\nOnce downloaded, Arabic voice input always uses this built-in engine and never touches the system or Google recognizer. The system recognizer is only used before the built-in model is downloaded, or for other languages.</string>
